Environment for perf_20190130_placement_prescan_throughput.log and perf_20190130_placement_firstadd_throughput.log
(the throughput_prescan and throughput_firstadd runs below). The same batch then ran the latency build with each
placement; those two logs are not in results/ (the placement latency logs come from 9f9ee75, recorded in
perf_20190130_placement_latency_env.log). The binaries were built into a scratch directory, shown below as bin/;
the runs used the directory holding 01302019.NASDAQ_ITCH50 as their working directory.
--- build (source: git archive of commit fec2f8ba44ce8136880245bcec71b1c1f28133e9 into a clean directory)
+ g++ --version
+ head -1
